WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.880
When working with AI in the IDE

2
00:00:02.880 --> 00:00:04.940
I really wanted to know in real time

3
00:00:04.940 --> 00:00:07.420
how much quota I had left to use

4
00:00:07.420 --> 00:00:09.660
So I built an IDE extension

5
00:00:09.660 --> 00:00:13.600
to display live account status at the bottom of the IDE

6
00:00:13.600 --> 00:00:16.120
showing how much quota is available

7
00:00:16.120 --> 00:00:19.960
along with daily suggested pacing and bias variance

8
00:00:19.960 --> 00:00:23.900
Clicking opens an advanced settings panel

9
00:00:23.900 --> 00:00:27.860
to refresh balances and customize display themes

10
00:00:27.860 --> 00:00:30.820
as well as set background auto-check intervals

11
00:00:30.820 --> 00:00:33.720
allowing full control over daily AI usage
